  "title": "Signing out of the app is not signing out of the OP",
  "desc": "Three stages. First Priya is signed in at ExampleCRM and at the OP, two separate sessions. When ExampleCRM's Sign out button only clears its own session cookie, ExampleCRM's session ends but the OP session is still there, and if she signs in again the OP may sign her straight back in. When the app sends the browser to the OP's logout address, that is how the OP session is ended, though the OP may still ask her whether to log out there too.",
